  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.6.8: HeifPhotosEdit re-applies the 15 sliders of the Apple Photos \"Adjust\" panel (HeifPhotosAdjustments, on the Photos scale) to a decoded photo, fitted to 94 Photos exports of three scenes; warmth, tint, vignette, brightness and contrast close, exposure, sharpness and noise reduction rough. About 0.2 s for 12 MP (1 s with detail filters), independent of the thread count. Adds public API; existing API unchanged. Requires PictureSharp 0.7.6. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp.Heif/blob/v0.6.8/docs/releases/release-0.6.8.md",
